The net change in the balance of employee separations liability during 2004 is calculated as:
\[ \text{Net change} = \text{liability as of december 31 2004} - \text{liability as of january 1 2004} \]

Using the values from the table:
- Liability as of January 1, 2004: $2239
- Liability as of December 31, 2004: $665

The calculation is:
\[ 665 - 2239 \]

